  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Reliability",
      "items": [
        "Successful changes commit their outbox row in the same transaction as business data",
        "Kafka keyed by aggregate ID; failed events go to a DLQ topic",
        "notify commits its offset only after Resend accepts the email or Kafka acknowledges the message in its retry or DLQ topic",
        "Outbox Relay runs inside api: it locks unpublished rows with SKIP LOCKED, publishes them, then sets published_at"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Audit",
      "items": [
        "api authorizes the user, then queries the audit read API",
        "Only audit reads or writes the audit database",
        "Denied or failed change attempts commit their outbox row in a separate transaction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Email delivery",
      "items": [
        "api writes one email.requested outbox row per recipient: template, to and variables",
        "notify sends each email through Resend with Idempotency-Key = event_id",
        "429 rate_limit_exceeded and 409 concurrent_idempotent_requests wait and retry in place up to 3 times, then go to notify's retry topic",
        "Network errors and 5xx go to notify's retry topic, which retries with backoff until 12 hours after the event, then moves the message to its DLQ topic",
        "Quota errors and other 4xx, including invalid_idempotent_request, go to notify's DLQ topic",
        "notify never sends an email whose event is more than 24 hours old, because Resend keeps idempotency keys for 24 hours; it moves the message to its DLQ topic instead",
        "Bounces and complaints handled by the Resend suppression list"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Observability",
      "items": [
        "api, auth, Outbox Relay, audit and notify export OTLP to otel; these edges are not drawn",
        "notify exports Resend quota usage from response headers and plan limits from its config; Grafana alerts Discord at 80% (warning) and 100% (critical) of the daily and monthly quota",
        "notify counts Resend failures and expired emails by reason; every DLQ message raises a Grafana alert",
        "notify's DLQ topic keeps failed and expired messages with their reason for 3 days; an operator resends from it outside the notify consumer",
        "Before resending a message with an unknown send outcome more than 24 hours after its event, the operator checks Resend Logs or confirms that a duplicate is acceptable"
      ]
    }
  ]
